WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.897
Mole's friends were upset.

2
00:00:03.898 --> 00:00:08.138
But Mole was too excited to notice.

3
00:00:08.139 --> 00:00:11.139
He kept telling his story:

4
00:00:11.140 --> 00:00:13.779
"I told the ferrets more.

5
00:00:13.780 --> 00:00:17.712
'A hundred badgers will attack,' I said.

6
00:00:17.713 --> 00:00:21.720
'They will hide in the barn with guns.

7
00:00:21.721 --> 00:00:25.530
Rats will attack from the river,' I said.

8
00:00:25.531 --> 00:00:29.360
'There will be six boats full of rats.

9
00:00:29.361 --> 00:00:32.801
And the rats will carry swords.'"

10
00:00:32.802 --> 00:00:35.960
"Swords?" asked Rat.

11
00:00:35.961 --> 00:00:39.710
"What about the toads?" asked Toad.

12
00:00:39.711 --> 00:00:43.761
"The toads will attack with clubs," said Mole.

13
00:00:43.762 --> 00:00:48.182
"A gang will charge through the garden!"

14
00:00:48.183 --> 00:00:52.344
"What a story!" shouted Rat.

15
00:00:52.345 --> 00:00:55.931
"Then I ran away," said Mole.

16
00:00:55.932 --> 00:00:58.553
"I hid for a little while.

17
00:00:58.554 --> 00:01:01.810
Then I quietly came back."

18
00:01:01.811 --> 00:01:06.523
Badger leaned forward to listen.

19
00:01:06.524 --> 00:01:10.693
"The ferrets were all afraid," said Mole.

20
00:01:10.694 --> 00:01:14.304
"They ran here and there, shouting."

21
00:01:14.305 --> 00:01:17.494
"Oh Mole!" cried Toad.

22
00:01:17.495 --> 00:01:20.227
"You warned them!

23
00:01:20.228 --> 00:01:23.435
You spoiled everything!"

24
00:01:23.436 --> 00:01:30.076
"Mole," said Badger, "you are very clever!

25
00:01:30.077 --> 00:01:34.234
You played a very smart trick."

26
00:01:34.235 --> 00:01:38.727
Badger patted Mole on the back.

27
00:01:38.728 --> 00:01:42.138
Toad could not believe it!

28
00:01:42.139 --> 00:01:45.801
"Mole wasn't clever," he thought.

29
00:01:45.802 --> 00:01:50.071
"Mole warned the Wild-Wooders!"

